                   Process by iterating current missing values y with rank r:
                   usedKnownLess(y-1) = (y-1) - currentMissingLess(y-1)
                                      = (y-1) - (r-1) - currentUsedUnusedLess? not enough.
                   Simpler: use current used-known BIT directly per y.
                */
                ll sumUsedKnownLess = 0;
                for (int t = 1; t <= K; t++) {
